  "question": "Which zoo is closest forward of University of North Georgia (Oconee Campus), Watkinsville, GA when heading toward David J. Sencer CDC Museum, Atlanta, GA?",
  "sql": "WITH\n    angle AS (SELECT degrees(ST_Azimuth(ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-83.42624 33.866134)',4326)::geography, ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-84.329665 33.799189)',4326)::geography)) AS value)\nSELECT * FROM pois,angle\nWHERE tourism = 'zoo'\nAND (degrees(ST_Azimuth(ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-83.42624 33.866134)',4326)::geography, pois.geometry)) BETWEEN angle.value - 22.5 AND angle.value + 22.5)\nORDER BY pois.geometry <-> ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-83.42624 33.866134)',4326)::geography ASC\nLIMIT 1;\n",
